[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    14[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    15[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Public entry points.** Four, all exported (`nm -D`), listed low-level first:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    16[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
