[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    19[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 3. `good(void)` — wraps `printLine(helperGood1())`
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    20[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 4. `driver(int)` — top-level convenience wrapper over `good`/`bad`
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    21[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
