[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    25[0m:[38;5;10m[49m non-null and then hands the pointer to C stdio, so the shapes that matter are
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    26[0m:[38;5;10m[49m the ones stdio and the terminator scan distinguish: length (0 / 1 / small /
