[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     39[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     40[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// `target/<profile>/libdriver.so`, i.e. the cdylib produced by this crate.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     41[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ///
